  "title": "Oma Kiener&#39;s Hazelnut Christmas Cookies",
  "description": "An inherited recipe, these buttery hazelnut cookies are a snap to make and simple to bake. Prepare the dough and refrigerate as a log, then slice into rounds, decorate with candy sprinkles, and bake. Easy!",
  "authors": [
    "KitchenGeisha"
  ],
