  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "1 egg",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour, sifted",
    "0.25 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 cup ground hazelnuts",
    "1 egg, beaten",
    "0.25 cup multicolored candy sprinkles (jimmies), or amount needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QjYVqpw2gs4QBgX9YaGxh28tdqw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/155821-oma-kieners-hazelnut-christmas-cookies-VAT-step-01-baf3e651b1bf4e6ebeb6f5fb7c035294.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155821/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter, sugar, egg, and salt together in a mixing bowl until light and fluffy. Stir in flour and baking soda, and mix just until blended. Mix in hazelnuts.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BSDElwh582kjNI5uIp88Zn9CMFc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/155821-oma-kieners-hazelnut-christmas-cookies-VAT-step-02-4b2ec65e5f4546468fba66167b716929.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155821/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn dough out onto a lightly floured surface and shape into 2 1/2 inch log. Wrap snugly in wax paper, and refrigerate overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Tj5b0q08NNHM0H0B_w0g_s2pnpw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/155821-oma-kieners-hazelnut-christmas-cookies-VAT-step-03-7e66df603cfb42259d2607f7bb160612.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155821/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Lightly grease baking sheets. Unwrap, and cut the log into 1/8 inch thick slices.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KnbWxOs5jrlwXE4jw5Gm-9YrFsc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/155821-oma-kieners-hazelnut-christmas-cookies-VAT-step-04-479a430250b845a3adbf84dfe2687a6e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155821/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 2 inches apart on the prepared baking sheets. Brush tops with beaten egg and decorate with sprinkles, if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c3h8XIZHcWvh2gw0b1btQeJJsHU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/155821-oma-kieners-hazelnut-christmas-cookies-VAT-step-05-5d833629206148b18b2ac8cb79261f8c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155821/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in preheated oven until edges are lightly browned, 12 to 15 minutes. Cool on racks, and store in an airtight tin.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NUzB81eqbzyhr3ADGbqc17qY7KU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/155821-oma-kieners-hazelnut-christmas-cookies-VAT-step-06-5495b89ddcba424b81f383cc96de8aac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155821/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
